1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,490
乔 你马上要看到人生第一场雪啦
Joe, you're going to see your first snow.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,610
-太令人激动了 -我等不及要做个雪银了
- It's so exciting! - I can't wait to make a snow person!

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:07,970
银
"Person"?

4
00:00:07,990 --> 00:00:09,740
我们不能再让他上那个嬉皮学校了
We got to get him out of that hippie school.

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,570
别这样 杰
I don't know, Jay.

6
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:13,090
上次的成绩单上他得的是全海豚[全优]
Last report card, he got straight dolphins.

7
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:16,120
哥伦比亚的圣诞总是又热又嘈杂
Christmas in Colombia was always hot and loud,

8
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:19,210
人们争吵 背叛 阴谋
people arguing, betrayal, schemes.

9
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:21,930
所以我为全家租了座山顶小屋
So I rented a mountain cabin for the whole family

10
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:24,750
来庆祝我成为美国人后的第一个圣诞节
to celebrate my first Christmas as an American.

11
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:26,840
我想要一个白色圣诞节
I want a white christmas,

12
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:29,360
就像白人过的那种
You know, like white people have.

13
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,590
想在我们出发之前
Hey, want to hit the pipe one more time

14
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:32,870
再来一发吗
before we get on the road?

15
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,680
可以啊 试试也不错
Um, yeah. Couldn't hurt.

16
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,280
*平安夜*
*Silent night*

17
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,240
*圣善夜*
*Holy night*

18
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,810
天哪 我们太赞了
Oh, my God, we are killing it!

19
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,510
去年圣诞 米奇尔和我觉得
Last christmas, Mitchell and I thought it would be fun

20
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:48,040
给全家唱圣诞颂歌应该蛮好玩的
to sing a little Christmas carol for the family.

21
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:50,200
但可惜的是结果不是很好
Unfortunately, it didn't go so well

22
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,430
因为有些人喝得有点多
because somebody had a little too much to drink.

23
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,420
别晃你那小眼珠子了 我是当时太紧张了
Stop doing that. I was nervous.

24
00:00:57,430 --> 00:01:00,460
*正是愉快的季节*
*'tis the season to be jolly*

25
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:05,700
*穿上欢庆[基佬]的服装*
*Don we now our gay apparel*

26
00:01:07,390 --> 00:01:08,310
米奇尔
Mitchell?

27
00:01:09,070 --> 00:01:11,870
全家人无情地嘲笑了我们一整年
The family has been mocking us relentlessly all year.

28
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:13,980
起了一堆绰号 像什么"尖声与赫伯"
Nicknames like Screeches & Herb,

29
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:16,030
"西蒙和真磕碜" "五分钱"
Simon & God-awful, Nickelback.

30
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:17,950
但是今年我们要挽回尊严
But we're gonna redeem ourselves this year.

31
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:20,170
我们已经为新曲子排练了好几个月
We have been rehearsing our new number for months,

32
00:01:20,170 --> 00:01:22,670
我们会在小屋里首演
and we will debut it at the cabin

33
00:01:22,670 --> 00:01:25,730
作为特别的节日打脸大礼送给全家
as a special holiday "Screw you" to the family.

34
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,350
马蒂 听我说
Hey, Marty, listen,

35
00:01:27,350 --> 00:01:29,960
虽说你的宾馆你做主 但是你的客人们
it's your hotel, but a walnut closet

36
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:32,290
会想把他们的衣服挂在胡桃木衣柜里
is a place your guests want to hang their clothes.

37
00:01:32,290 --> 00:01:34,810
要是木屑板衣柜 不如自挂东南枝
A particleboard closet -- they want to hang themselves.

38
00:01:34,810 --> 00:01:37,390
天天谈衣柜都快把我搞疯了
All this closet stuff is driving me nuts.

39
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,480
我也想生气
I want to get annoyed,

40
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:40,550
但是我现在感觉太爽了 很难生气
but it's hard when I feel this comfortable.

41
00:01:40,550 --> 00:01:42,650
老天 他又要开始说他的新大衣了
Oh, God, he's gonna talk about his new coat again.

42
00:01:42,650 --> 00:01:45,300
就好像是有一只母羊抱着我一样温暖
It's like getting a big, warm hug from a mama sheep.

43
00:01:45,410 --> 00:01:47,350
没什么比得上纯羊皮的感觉
Nothing feels like pure sheepskin.

44
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,310
买衣服的那姑娘说
The gal at the store said

45
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:50,160
我看着像克里斯·克里斯托佛森[美国音乐家]
I looked like Kris Kristofferson.

46
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,870
我们又不知道他是谁
We don't know who that is.

47
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,010
我这个假期
I have so much lab homework

48
00:01:53,010 --> 00:01:54,820
有超多实验作业要做
to get done during this break.

49
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:56,260
要是我能做决定
If it were up to me,

50
00:01:56,260 --> 00:01:58,270
我不会让今年的圣诞到来
Christmas wouldn't even come this year.

51
00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:00,990
你还能更像卡通里的坏人一点吗
Any chance you could sound more like a cartoon villain?

52
00:02:00,990 --> 00:02:04,370
拜托 艾丽克斯 整整三天的冬日欢乐
Come on, Alex, it's three solid days of winter fun.

53
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,990
我们要坐雪橇 滑冰
We're gonna go sledding, skating,

54
00:02:05,990 --> 00:02:08,120
冰钓 做雪天使
ice-fishing, make snow angels.

55
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:10,630
谁跟我一起 雪 雪
Who's with me?! Snow, snow!

56
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:15,100
雪 雪 雪 雪 雪 雪
Snow, snow, snow, snow, snow, snow, snow!

57
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,400
那是雪吗
Snow?

58
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,860
不是 那是叶子
No, that's a leaf.

59
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:19,390
这里比家里还热呢
It's hotter here than at home.

60
00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:21,030
歌洛莉亚 你的每日邮件里
Gloria, in your little daily e-mails,

61
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,360
说的可是会很冷啊
you said it was gonna be cold.

62
00:02:22,370 --> 00:02:23,790
我的手机上就是这么写的啊
That's what my phone said.

63
00:02:23,790 --> 00:02:25,300
你用的是摄氏度
You're on celsius.

64
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,630
会很热哦 各位
It's going to be hot, guys!

65
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,570
火炉开着呢吗
Oh, is the furnace on?!

66
00:02:43,570 --> 00:02:44,810
菲尔 快把外套脱了吧
Phil, take off that jacket.

67
00:02:44,810 --> 00:02:46,750
看着你我都觉得浑身发热
You're making me hot just looking at you.

68
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:48,700
售货员说过会有这个效果
Saleslady said that would happen.

69
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:50,450
相信我 我凉爽如黄瓜
Trust me, I'm cool as cucumber.

70
00:02:50,450 --> 00:02:53,510
这衣服好像懂得我的身体需要什么一样
Something about the coat just knows what my body needs.

71
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,300
你现在像海洛因上瘾了一样流着汗呢
You're sweating like a heroin addict.

72
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,880
快看 有钢琴呢
Oh, hey, look, a piano.

73
00:02:57,890 --> 00:03:01,050
要不听"唱崩的哥俩"[卡朋特兄妹]唱首歌吧
Maybe we can get a little song from the Crapenters.

74
00:03:04,550 --> 00:03:05,460
冷静
Be cool.

75
00:03:05,470 --> 00:03:06,640
安迪的未婚妻贝丝得工作
Andy's fiancee, Beth, has to work,

76
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,210
所以歌洛莉亚请他来过圣诞
so Gloria invited him for Christmas,

77
00:03:08,210 --> 00:03:09,870
情况很复杂
which is complicated

78
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:13,300
因为我们俩滚床单了 但是没人知道
because we've been having sex and nobody knows about it.

79
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:14,980
当然 我们自己知道
I mean, we know.

80
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:16,840
不能让我家人知道我们的事情
My family cannot find out about us.

81
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,340
我当然不会告诉他们
I'm certainly not gonna tell them.

82
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,720
他们还算尊重我
I still have their respect.

83
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:22,660
安迪 快点 乔做出想大号的表情了
Andy, chop-chop. Joe's making his bathroom face.

84
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,830
好了 我们快回家吧
All right, let's just go home.

85
00:03:23,830 --> 00:03:25,600
这里这么热 又没有无线
I mean, it's hot. There's no wi-fi.

86
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,810
艾丽克斯 别这么扫兴
Alex, stop being the grinch.

87
00:03:27,810 --> 00:03:31,440
如果这是最糟糕的问题 那祝你圣诞快乐
If that is the worst problem, then merry Christmas.

88
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:33,070
谢天谢地 你们都来了
Oh, thank God you made it!

89
00:03:33,070 --> 00:03:36,400
我还以为你们出车祸了呢
I thought you'd gotten into a horrible car accident!

90
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:38,520
等等
Wait a second.

91
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:41,710
你们不是特里普 塔德 洛伊斯 达西和马琳
You're not Trip, Tad, Lois, Darcy, and Marlene.

92
00:03:41,710 --> 00:03:43,780
-不是 我们有别的名字 -你们是谁
- No, we're other names. - Who are you?

93
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:44,830
费格·威尔逊
Fig Wilson.

94
00:03:44,830 --> 00:03:47,480
我们全家每年都在这里过圣诞
My family's been coming here for the holidays for years.

95
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,580
我们就是从威尔逊家把这个小屋租过来的
We rented this cabin from the Wilsons.

96
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:52,180
-他们去夏威夷了 -没人跟我说过啊
- They are in Hawaii. - Nobody told me that.

97
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:54,400
那就只能 再见啦
Okay, well, bye-bye.

98
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:56,260
他们怎么能抛下我啊
How could they abandon me?

99
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,810
我是家里最体贴的人啊
Uh, I'm the most caring one in the family.

100
00:03:57,810 --> 00:03:59,960
我警告他们小心癌症
I warn them about cancer.

101
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:03,220
我给他们的胖小孩买"超乎想象"尺寸的衣服
I buy their fat kids clothes in aspirational sizes.

102
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:05,740
我请他们所有人来参加我狗狗的葬礼
I invite them all to my dogs' funerals.

103
00:04:05,850 --> 00:04:08,080
上一只狗直接冲到车流里
Last one ran straight into traffic.

104
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,070
我能理解原因
I can see that.

105
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:11,030
有没有可能是邀请函搞丢了
Is it possible the invitation got lost?

106
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:13,860
你看上去很不错啊
I mean... you seem great.

107
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:17,570
那我就去拿我的包走下山吧
Well, I guess I'll just get my bags and walk down the hill.

108
00:04:17,770 --> 00:04:20,670
希望我能在天黑前赶到巴士站
Hopefully, I'll get to the bus station before nightfall.

109
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,120
现在是狼出没的季节
It's wolf season.

110
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,220
你何不跟我们一起过呢
Why don't you stay here with us?

111
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,180
圣诞节啊
It's Christmas.

112
00:04:28,740 --> 00:04:29,820
我第一眼看到你的时候
First time I saw you,

113
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:31,860
还以为你会是那种刺儿头
I thought you were gonna be a pain in the ass,

114
00:04:31,870 --> 00:04:35,240
但结果你是我的最爱啊
but it turns out you're my favorite.

115
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:42,910
你们觉得里面是什么东西啊
What do you think's in here?

116
00:04:42,910 --> 00:04:46,150
没人告诉你那个被遗忘男孩的传说吗
No one told you the legend of the Forgotten Boy?

117
00:04:46,450 --> 00:04:49,280
一百年前就是在这里发生的
Happened right here 100 years ago.

118
00:04:49,490 --> 00:04:51,340
一个男孩非常坏
A boy was very bad,

119
00:04:51,340 --> 00:04:54,500
所以他父母把他锁在这个秘密的房间里
and his parents locked him in this secret room

120
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:56,520
任由他在这里自生自灭
and left him here forever.

121
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,200
他们说在夜里 你能听到他
They say at night, you can hear him

122
00:04:58,200 --> 00:05:00,480
努力挠墙要爬出来的声音
trying to scratch his way out.

123
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:03,020
我们吓到她了
We got her.

124
00:05:03,170 --> 00:05:04,560
蠢货
Idiots.

125
00:05:05,910 --> 00:05:07,800
刚才是你在挠墙 对吧
That was you scratching, right?

126
00:05:09,340 --> 00:05:10,100
抱歉
Oh, sorry.

127
00:05:10,110 --> 00:05:12,450
-你先走 -没关系 你先
- No, you go. - No, it's okay. After you.

128
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:13,740
我就...
Here, I'll just...

129
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:16,090
我干嘛不
Oh, why don't I go...

130
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:19,530
你们俩在干嘛 瞪眼比赛吗
What are you guys doing -- having a staring contest?

131
00:05:19,530 --> 00:05:20,720
我赢过很多次哦
I got winners!

132
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:22,150
晚点再说 先跟我来
Later, though. Come here.

133
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:24,280
安迪
Andy...

134
00:05:24,590 --> 00:05:26,550
我要送你一个特别的礼物
I've got a very special present for you.

135
00:05:26,550 --> 00:05:29,080
这家伙告诉你他考到地产经纪执照了吗
Did this guy tell you he passed his real-estate-license test?

136
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,380
我知道 我帮他背书[塞进去]的
I know. I helped him cram.

137
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:32,260
她逼[扭]我逼得可紧了
Ah, she's really drilling me pretty hard.

138
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:34,820
真棒 听我说 我刚进入房地产行业时
Cool. Listen, when I first got into real estate,

139
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:37,050
进了一间要穿西装上班的大公司
I worked at one of those big firms with the blazers.

140
00:05:37,050 --> 00:05:38,810
我还是别提公司的名字了
I'd rather not say their name,

141
00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:40,760
不过名字压的是"世纪地产好无聊"的韵
but it rhymed with "Century not very fun."

142
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,910
不管怎样 我保留了这件
Anyway, I saved this.

143
00:05:44,290 --> 00:05:45,790
我想把它送给你
I'd like for you to have it.

144
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:49,640
穿上之后 你要牢记我们这一行的价值观
When you wear it, remember the values of our profession --

145
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:53,110
信任 尊重 诚信 忠实和纯粹
Trust, honor, integrity, fidelity, and purity.

146
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:56,260
你能配得上这件西装外套吗 安迪
Are you worthy of the blazer, Andy?

147
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,380
我会的
I want to be.

148
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:59,710
我没想到会这么激动
I didn't expect it to hit this hard.

149
00:05:59,710 --> 00:06:00,750
我也是
Me either.

150
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:04,870
谁想来点蛋奶酒
Who wants eggnog?

151
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:07,080
我要来点 这周工作太辛苦了
I'll take some. I had a tough week at work.

152
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,140
你是做什么的
What do you do?

153
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:10,260
我父亲和我身处橱柜行业
Oh, my dad and I are in the closet business.

154
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:13,120
什么 我差点听成"橱柜行业"
I'm sorry, it almost sounded like you said, "Closet business".

155
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:16,610
我专门负责解决住宅及酒店储物问题
I did -- residential and hospitality storage solutions.

156
00:06:16,610 --> 00:06:17,810
无聊
Yikes.

157
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,320
小不点儿 我快无聊死了
Hey, specks, I'm dying over there.

158
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:21,110
你在看什么呢
What are you reading?

159
00:06:21,110 --> 00:06:22,910
关于科学的 你肯定会觉得很无聊
Science stuff. I'm sure it'll bore you.

160
00:06:22,910 --> 00:06:25,420
我在麻省理工教天体物理学
I teach astrophysics at M.I.T.

161
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:26,430
等等
Wait a minute.

162
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:28,800
-你是F.N.威尔逊吗 -正是在下
- Are you F.N. Wilson? - F-N right, I am!

163
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,340
我们刚读完你写的那篇太阳耀斑
We just read your essay on how solar flares

164
00:06:30,340 --> 00:06:31,560
会怎样毁掉地球生命的文章
will wipe out life on earth!

165
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:34,170
希望是在橱柜女士对上我之前
Hopefully before closet lady corners me again.

166
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,510
大家都在这里
Everybody's here,

167
00:06:35,510 --> 00:06:36,880
所以我们就放松点
So let's just casually

168
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,330
慢慢靠近钢琴
make our way over to the piano.

169
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:40,140
你喝的是什么啊 斯嘉丽[猩红]小姐
Ooh, what are we drinking there, Miss Scarlet?

170
00:06:40,140 --> 00:06:42,610
放轻松 是热茶 对我嗓子好
Relax. It's hot tea for my throat.

171
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:44,520
我们最好让莉莉来摄影
Oh, we should have Lily film us.

172
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,610
莉莉 过来
Hey, Lily, come here.

173
00:06:45,910 --> 00:06:47,110
大爸和我等一下
Okay, so, Daddy and I are about

174
00:06:47,110 --> 00:06:48,350
要唱一首圣诞歌 然后...
to sing a Christmas song, and --

175
00:06:48,350 --> 00:06:49,790
我现在就要打断你们
I'm gonna stop you right there.

176
00:06:49,790 --> 00:06:51,280
不 这次跟去年不一样
No, it's not gonna be like last year

177
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:54,690
因为我们精心准备了 而且唱的是《平安夜》
because we're prepared and we're singing "Silent Night".

178
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:57,220
我最喜欢那首歌了 我能跟你们一起唱吗
That's my favorite. Can I sing with you?

179
00:07:01,550 --> 00:07:04,100
大家请听我说两句
Can I have everyone's attention, please?

180
00:07:05,460 --> 00:07:07,690
我能够跟任何人梦寐以求
I feel so lucky celebrating

181
00:07:07,690 --> 00:07:10,510
最棒的家人一起庆祝节日简直无比幸运
with the best damn family any man could hope for.

182
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:11,730
老爸
Dad.

183
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:13,600
-当然还有费格 -大家好
- And Fig. - Hey, all!

184
00:07:14,100 --> 00:07:16,270
歌洛莉亚和我经过一段时间的讨论
Gloria and I have been talking about this for a while.

185
00:07:16,270 --> 00:07:17,350
乔也越来越大了
What with Joe getting older,

186
00:07:17,350 --> 00:07:20,100
我觉得是时候开始人生新篇章了
I feel it's just the right time to start a new chapter,

187
00:07:20,100 --> 00:07:23,190
因此我决定 退休
which is why I've decided... to retire.

188
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:24,590
-天哪 -什么
- Oh, my. - What?!

189
00:07:24,590 --> 00:07:26,250
也许"退休"这个词用得不对
Maybe "Retired" is the wrong word --

190
00:07:26,250 --> 00:07:27,570
这更像是一种角色转换
more of a transition.

191
00:07:27,570 --> 00:07:30,190
所以要是有人问杰·普里契特去哪了
So, when people ask, "Where's Jay Pritchett?"

192
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:31,830
你们可以告诉他们 他转换[变性]去了
you tell them, "He's transitioning".

193
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:33,320
好吧 我也发现了
Oay, I heard it, too.

194
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,900
还是用"退休"吧
Let's go back to retiring.

195
00:07:34,900 --> 00:07:36,790
我们俩终于可以租那辆房车
Hey, we can finally rent that R.V.

196
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:39,050
去各大棒球队主场转转了
and visit all of the Major League ballparks.

197
00:07:39,050 --> 00:07:40,370
你还是自己去吧
You can probably go ahead and do that alone.

198
00:07:40,370 --> 00:07:42,750
总之 我当然得好好考虑
Uh, anyway, I had to ask myself,

199
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:45,180
由谁接手公司最合适
"Who's the best person to lead the company?"

200
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,230
答案很明显
And the answer is obvious.

201
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:50,010
-查克·菲尼 -谁
- Chuck Feeny. - Who?

202
00:07:50,290 --> 00:07:52,880
芝加哥来的无名少年
Gutters and screen hot shot out of Chicago.

203
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,980
有他担起公司重任
With him in charge,

204
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:58,120
我们也都可以高枕无忧了
we can all relax knowing that the company is in good hands.

205
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,630
克莱尔也会有个很棒的新老板
Claire gets a great new boss.

206
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:02,100
你们也能有更多的时间跟我相处
And you all get to spend more time with yours truly.

207
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:05,110
敬克莱尔的新老板
Well, to this one's new boss.

208
00:08:05,610 --> 00:08:06,980
克莱尔 这是我做手势的手
Claire, that's my gesturing hand.

209
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:08,350
工作时需要它
I need it for work.

210
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,430
我一周工作60个小时 就为了让
I work 60-hour weeks so Chuck Feeny can have

211
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:13,780
查克·菲尼能享有橱柜大会上最棒的位置
the corner office and the best table at closet con!

212
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:14,780
亲爱的 你走慢点
Honey, you need to slow down.

213
00:08:14,780 --> 00:08:16,710
这件衣服我还没穿惯 走不快
This coat isn't quite broken in yet.

214
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:19,390
听着 你完全有权生气
Listen, you have every right to be mad.

215
00:08:19,390 --> 00:08:21,680
所有人都知道那个位置是你应得的
Everyone knows you deserve that job.

216
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,310
想想看我那么多个周末的加班
And to think of all the weekends I worked

217
00:08:23,310 --> 00:08:25,450
那些被迫取消的家庭休假
and the -- the family vacations we've put off,

218
00:08:25,450 --> 00:08:28,020
更别提我受到的压力还有失眠
not to mention the stress and the insomnia and --

219
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:29,070
过来
Come here.

220
00:08:30,430 --> 00:08:33,150
克莱尔 人生就像蜿蜒的山路
Claire, life's like a mountain road...

221
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:36,510
每个转角都有新的奇遇在等着你
with a new adventure around every corner.

222
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,510
如果这是这件大衣的广告词
If that's the slogan for this stupid coat,

223
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:40,440
-我就杀了你 -别说话 抱紧我
- I'm gonna kill you! - Shh! Get in here.

224
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:44,980
-你见到克莱尔了吗 -没有
- Have you seen Claire? - No.

225
00:08:44,990 --> 00:08:47,780
我告诉过你查克·菲尼这主意很糟
I told you this Chuck Feeny thing was a terrible idea!

226
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:49,250
这主意超棒的
It's a brilliant idea.

227
00:08:49,250 --> 00:08:50,370
根本没有什么查克·菲尼
There is no Chuck Feeny.

228
00:08:50,370 --> 00:08:52,860
我编了这么个人 是因为我看到唐·麦克索里
I made him up because of what happened to Don McSorley

229
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:55,160
把公司传给他儿子的结果
when he turned his company over to his son.

230
00:08:55,550 --> 00:08:57,920
他儿子接受公司只是因为觉得自己有责任
Son only took the job because he felt obligated.

231
00:08:58,420 --> 00:09:00,840
一年以后 公司破产了
One year later, business went bankrupt.

232
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:03,330
我"悲痛"地花了原价8%的钱买下了
Broke my heart to buy his entire inventory

233
00:09:03,530 --> 00:09:05,010
他所有的库存
8 cents on the dollar.

234
00:09:05,830 --> 00:09:07,160
我这么做是为了克莱尔
I'm doing this for Claire.

235
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,800
她会竭尽全力让我开心
She'd do anything to make me happy,

236
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,990
而我不希望那是她接手公司的原因
and that's not why I want her to take the job.

237
00:09:10,990 --> 00:09:12,680
如果她想要 她就得努力去争取
If she wants it, she'll fight for it.

238
00:09:12,690 --> 00:09:14,310
如果不是 那我就给了她轻松离场的借口
If not, I just gave her an easy out.

239
00:09:14,310 --> 00:09:16,310
我能想到十种比这个好的方法
I can think of 10 better ways to do this.

240
00:09:16,310 --> 00:09:18,350
放松 结果一定会很棒的
Relax. It's gonna be perfect.

241
00:09:18,350 --> 00:09:20,020
她会来找我要属于她的东西
She'll come to me, demand what's hers.

242
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:22,370
我会告诉她真相 拥抱她 完美的圣诞节
I'll tell her the truth, big hug, perfect Christmas.

243
00:09:22,370 --> 00:09:24,570
-我真是太聪明了 -你真是疯了
- I'm a genius. - You're a crazy person.

244
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:27,110
在我们村子 我们会往你脖子上帮个易拉罐
In my village, we will tie a tin can around your neck

245
00:09:27,110 --> 00:09:28,640
这样听声音就知道你来了
to know when you're coming.

246
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:34,570
*平安夜*
*Silent night*

247
00:09:34,570 --> 00:09:37,990
*圣善夜*
*Holy night*

248
00:09:37,990 --> 00:09:41,610
*真宁静*
*All is calm*

249
00:09:41,610 --> 00:09:45,370
*真光明*
*All is bright*

250
00:09:45,370 --> 00:09:50,160
*圣光环绕圣母圣婴*
*'round yon virgin mother and child*

251
00:09:50,170 --> 00:09:51,930
我有个好主意
Okay, hey, hey, I have a fun idea!

252
00:09:51,930 --> 00:09:54,800
我们不如现在就把礼物拿一个给莉莉
Why don't we give Lily one of her presents right now?

253
00:09:55,310 --> 00:09:56,740
这主意不错 二爸
That is a fun idea, Daddy.

254
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:58,280
这样她就能去玩玩具
Then she can go play with a toy

255
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:01,110
而不是跟我们两个无聊的老男人待在一起
rather than being with us boring, old adults.

256
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,320
听起来怎么样 莉莉
How's that sound, Lily?

257
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,510
我觉得你们有什么阴谋 不过不关我事
I feel like you're up to something, but I don't care.

258
00:10:04,510 --> 00:10:06,830
我要礼物 我要那个自行车形状的
I want a present. I'll take the bike-shaped one.

259
00:10:06,830 --> 00:10:08,560
顺便说一句 包得挺不错的
Nice wrapping job, by the way.

260
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:09,900
那不是给乔的吗
Uh, wasn't that for Joe?

261
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:11,960
这下乔要收到洋娃娃了
Well, Joe's getting a doll now.

262
00:10:16,630 --> 00:10:18,520
歌洛莉亚让我取木柴
Gloria asked me to get some kindling.

263
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:21,510
你为什么仿佛什么都没穿地到处晃
Why are you walking around wearing next to nothing?

264
00:10:21,510 --> 00:10:23,000
外面可有26度
It's 26 celsius out there.

265
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,280
你看 我可是穿得严严实实的
Ah, I'm not showing any skin

266
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,450
免得诱惑到你
'cause I don't want to tempt you.

267
00:10:25,450 --> 00:10:27,300
你这金闪闪的外套保准让人性致全无
Oh, well, your gold blazer took care of that.

268
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:29,550
-你明明已经欲火难耐了 -是啊 为什么
- You know you're into it. - I know. Why?

269
00:10:29,550 --> 00:10:31,530
你真讨厌 还有你那犀利帅气的眼神
Damn you and that eagle scout smile.

270
00:10:31,530 --> 00:10:34,110
我也为你那迷人的大眼睛而沉醉
I want to take a swim in those big doe eyes.

271
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,640
开闸泄洪
This is happening.

272
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:38,140
-拿到柴火[硬]了吗 安迪 -什么
- Getting wood, Andy? - What?!

273
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:40,220
你能相信歌洛莉亚想弄传统的篝火吗
Can you believe Gloria wants a traditional fire?

274
00:10:40,220 --> 00:10:42,150
就好像这儿还不够热似的
As if it isn't hot enough in here.

275
00:10:42,150 --> 00:10:43,170
来吧 伙计
Come on, bro.

276
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:53,980
你好 莉莉
Hello, Lily.

277
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:55,050
你们穿的这是什么
What are you wearing?

278
00:10:55,050 --> 00:10:57,170
老妈让我们穿上圣诞毛衣
Mom made us put on our Christmas sweaters,

279
00:10:57,170 --> 00:10:58,520
但是你看看我们发现了什么
but look what we found.

280
00:10:58,520 --> 00:10:59,730
这上面有留言
It's a note.

281
00:11:02,860 --> 00:11:05,550
"我渴望饮用小女孩的鲜血"
"I'm hungry for the blood of a little girl."

282
00:11:05,570 --> 00:11:07,490
"落款是被遗忘的男孩"
"Signed, the forgotten boy."

283
00:11:07,490 --> 00:11:08,900
太恐怖了
This is terrifying.

284
00:11:08,900 --> 00:11:10,190
这下来真的了
It's getting real.

285
00:11:10,190 --> 00:11:12,900
最可怕的是他的拼写和两岁小孩的一样差
The scariest thing is that he spells like a 2-year-old.

286
00:11:13,490 --> 00:11:15,090
等等 你说什么
Wait, what?

287
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,720
给点力好吧
Dude.

288
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:20,400
这就是圣诞节
Christmas, huh?

289
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:22,210
谁出的这么糟糕的主意
Who the hell came up with this one?

290
00:11:22,210 --> 00:11:24,060
康斯坦丁大帝
It was Emperor Constantine.

291
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:25,230
真厉害
I love it!

292
00:11:25,230 --> 00:11:27,930
身为这屋里最聪明的人可不是容易的事
It's not easy being the smartest person in the room.

293
00:11:27,930 --> 00:11:29,810
我姐姐以为量子论是个游戏节目的名字
My sister thinks quantum theory is a game show,

294
00:11:29,810 --> 00:11:32,850
我弟弟还试过把裤子从头上脱下来
and my brother once tried to take his pants off over his head.

295
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:35,870
像咱们这样的姑娘早看清了家里的蠢事
Gals like us, we see through all the family B.S..

296
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:37,390
事事都门儿清
We call it like we see it.

297
00:11:37,390 --> 00:11:39,000
所以 如果我们在圣诞节
So, if we're alone for Christmas

298
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,830
或是生日和周末落单了 那是他们的损失
and birthdays and weekends, it's their loss.

299
00:11:41,830 --> 00:11:45,310
像咱们这样的姑娘从不需要有人作伴
Gals like us we don't need anyone.

300
00:11:45,330 --> 00:11:47,230
我不喜欢神叨叨 但是很明显
I'm not big on mysticism, but, clearly,

301
00:11:47,230 --> 00:11:49,310
这个女人是我未来独自庆祝圣诞的幻影
this woman was my ghost of Christmas future.

302
00:11:49,310 --> 00:11:51,830
所以我决定力挽狂澜
So, I decided to turn things around

303
00:11:51,830 --> 00:11:54,210
投入到节日的气氛之中
and jump in on the holiday spirit.

304
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,600
跳上"玩乐"号列车喽
Jump aboard the fun train!

305
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,290
那是火车启动的音效
That was a train.

306
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:02,820
这气味可真是香啊
Something smells good!

307
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:04,310
什么 什么糊了
What? What doesn't smell good?

308
00:12:04,310 --> 00:12:06,090
不 我说香
No, I-I said it did.

309
00:12:06,090 --> 00:12:07,930
我糊涂了 哪一点不合你心意了
I am confused! What is it that you don't like?!

310
00:12:07,930 --> 00:12:10,290
只是期待一下晚餐而已 我是爱你们的
I'm just excited for dinner. I love you guys.

311
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:12,490
别这么刻薄 我们尽全力了
Oh, don't be nasty. We're trying our best.

312
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:13,820
就是
Yes!

313
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:19,190
看看我找到了什么 神秘之屋的钥匙
Hey, look what I found -- a key to that secret room.

314
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,330
我的全家都在这里
My entire family is here.

315
00:12:20,330 --> 00:12:22,260
你知道那么做有多危险吗
Do you have any idea how dangerous that is?

316
00:12:22,260 --> 00:12:23,960
两分钟后见
Meet me in two minutes.

317
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:27,340
你终于出现了
There she is.

318
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:29,600
我宣布完大事以后就没再看见你
Haven't seen you since my big announcement.

319
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,650
你觉得怎么样
What do you think?

320
00:12:30,650 --> 00:12:32,510
我觉得我把我的一切都贡献给了公司
I think that I gave my all to this company

321
00:12:32,510 --> 00:12:35,100
然后如果你要让别的人接管掌权
and that if you were gonna hand over the reins to somebody,

322
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:38,170
那应该是我 而不是什么芝加哥无名小卒
it should be me and not some hump from Chicago!

323
00:12:38,170 --> 00:12:39,820
我碰巧想告诉你
Well, it just so happens --

324
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,350
我还没说完 老爸
I'm not finished, Dad!

325
00:12:41,350 --> 00:12:42,650
谢谢你救了我
Thank you for saving me

326
00:12:42,650 --> 00:12:44,940
让我接下来的20年免受
from wasting the next 20 years of my life

327
00:12:44,950 --> 00:12:48,500
整日谈论板条 长杆还有铰链的烦闷
talking about slats, rods, and hinges --

328
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:50,400
让我不用再在世上最无聊的行当里
from becoming the most boring person

329
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:52,550
做那个最无聊的人
in the most boring industry on earth!

330
00:12:52,550 --> 00:12:53,770
-"无聊"吗 -无聊
- "Boring"?! - Boring!

331
00:12:53,770 --> 00:12:56,420
是衣柜让混乱的世界变得井然有序
Closets bring order to a chaotic world!

332
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:59,210
-怎么了 -我告诉你怎么回事吧
- What happened? - I'll tell you what happened.

333
00:12:59,210 --> 00:13:00,940
我养了一个自私的没良心的女儿
I raised a mean, ungrateful daughter,

334
00:13:00,940 --> 00:13:03,280
然后我很庆幸让查克·菲尼来接管公司
and I'm glad I gave the business to Chuck Feeny!

335
00:13:03,280 --> 00:13:05,520
根本就没有查克·菲尼这个人
There is no Chuck Feeny!

336
00:13:15,910 --> 00:13:17,480
曼尼 卢克 你们够了
Manny, Luke, knock it off!

337
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,340
这么逗我一点意思都没有
No one thinks it's funny!

338
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:21,150
你是在跟我们说话吗
Are you talking to us?

339
00:13:25,210 --> 00:13:27,760
既然大家都坐好了 那么
Hey, as long as everybody's just sitting around, uh --

340
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:29,400
他们要再唱一首
Oh, they're gonna do another one!

341
00:13:29,610 --> 00:13:31,480
谢谢 圣诞老人
Thank you, Santa Claus!

342
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,600
挺逗的
That's hilarious.

343
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,550
你们继续笑 等下你们就笑不起来了
Hope you're having fun, 'cause that's about to end.

344
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:36,180
行了 跟着计划走 亲爱的
Okay, stick to the scripted patter, sweetie.

345
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:38,950
预备 一 二
And a one and a two.

346
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:41,840
*平安夜*
*Silent night*

347
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,750
我天 那是怎么回事
Oh, my god, what was that?

348
00:13:43,770 --> 00:13:44,440
-肯定没事 -没事的
- Oh, I'm sure it's fine. - Fine. It's no big deal.

349
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,800
那么米奇尔 我们从头唱起
So, Mitchell, here we go again.

350
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:48,440
*平安夜*
*Silent night*

351
00:13:48,450 --> 00:13:50,690
是你们女儿在叫
That is your daughter screaming!

352
00:13:52,150 --> 00:13:53,930
-莉莉 你没事吧 -怎么回事
- Lily, are you okay?! - What's going on?!

353
00:13:53,940 --> 00:13:56,640
被遗忘的男孩 我听见了 他在里面
The Forgotten Boy -- I heard him! He's in there!

354
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:59,000
-他在里头哦 -我们让他出来好吗
- Of course he is. - All right, let's get him out, huh?

355
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,840
-我们会保证他不再来烦 -老天
- We'll make sure that he doesn't bother -- - Oh, god!

356
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:03,140
我的天
Oh, god!

357
00:14:04,050 --> 00:14:05,090
安迪
Andy?

358
00:14:05,770 --> 00:14:07,330
把那件外套脱下来
Take off the blazer.

359
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:11,140
我们只是在找晚饭用的餐巾纸
We were just looking for dinner napkins.

360
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:12,840
在哪儿找 她的衣服里面吗
Where? In her shirt?

361
00:14:12,890 --> 00:14:14,740
我有好多问题想问
I have so many questions.

362
00:14:14,740 --> 00:14:16,750
男生们 莉莉 去本该有雪的地方玩吧
Boys, Lily, go play where snow would be.

363
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:18,850
这是怎么一回事儿
So, is this a thing?

364
00:14:18,850 --> 00:14:19,790
你们这是头一回吗
Is it the first time?

365
00:14:19,790 --> 00:14:20,530
-不是 -是的
- No. - Yes!

366
00:14:20,530 --> 00:14:21,630
安迪
Andy!

367
00:14:21,670 --> 00:14:22,950
我不想再说谎了
I-I'm sick of the lies.

368
00:14:23,510 --> 00:14:25,090
我们一直有着不正当的关系
We've been having improper relations.

369
00:14:25,090 --> 00:14:26,270
你不是已经订婚了吗
Aren't you engaged?

370
00:14:26,270 --> 00:14:28,070
这会儿你倒想起忠诚来了
Oh, suddenly, you're concerned about loyalty.

371
00:14:28,070 --> 00:14:29,500
原来你在跟我说话 不会觉得无聊吗
Oh, you're talking to me. Won't that bore you?

372
00:14:29,500 --> 00:14:31,890
-很明显我就是这么无聊 -听着 各位
- Apparently, I'm boring! - Listen, everyone,

373
00:14:31,890 --> 00:14:34,460
别让这事搅黄了我们美好的节日
let's not let this ruin our beautiful holiday.

374
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:36,370
艾丽克斯 现在没人要听你的讽刺
Alex, nobody needs your sarcasm right now!

375
00:14:36,370 --> 00:14:37,450
不要幸灾乐祸 亲爱的
It's ugly, honey.

376
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:40,200
这是安迪和海莉的私事而已
This is Andy and Haley's private business.

377
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:42,690
我觉得我们应该关注的是这特别的夜晚
I think we should be focused on this special night.

378
00:14:42,690 --> 00:14:44,500
这特别平安的平安夜
This special silent night.

379
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:45,670
一 二 走起
One and a two.

380
00:14:45,670 --> 00:14:48,370
*平安夜*
*Silent night*

381
00:14:48,370 --> 00:14:51,230
-*圣善--* -各位 我有个惊喜给你们
- *Hol--* - Guys, I have a surprise!

382
00:14:51,310 --> 00:14:53,430
那就是贝丝
It's Beth!

383
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:54,960
我的老天
Oh, my god.

384
00:14:55,210 --> 00:14:57,050
这是我准备的圣诞惊喜其中之一
This is one of my Christmas surprises.

385
00:14:57,050 --> 00:15:01,020
安迪 你还是可以和未婚妻一起过圣诞
Andy, you can spend Christmas with your fiancé after all!

386
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:03,130
-小宝贝 -小南瓜
- Hi, bittle-battle! - Hey, pumpkin!

387
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:05,620
贝丝 不介意我和你男人先聊两句吧
Beth, you mind if I have a quick chitchat with your man?

388
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:06,950
就是 我带贝丝参观参观这房子
Yeah, I'll give Beth a tour of the house

389
00:15:06,950 --> 00:15:08,810
你们让歌洛莉亚了解最新情况
while we get Gloria up to speed.

390
00:15:08,810 --> 00:15:10,030
你肯定也超爱节日吧
Don't you just love the holidays?

391
00:15:10,030 --> 00:15:12,910
奇妙满满 惊喜满满 还有
Full of wonder and magic and surprise and --

392
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:14,040
什么鬼
What?!

393
00:15:15,170 --> 00:15:16,090
坐下
Sit.

394
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:17,680
邓菲先生 我非常...
Mr. Dunphy, I am s--

395
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:18,980
没轮到你说话
It's not your turn to talk.

396
00:15:19,490 --> 00:15:21,400
那是我的女儿 而你已经跟别人订婚了
That's my daughter, and you're engaged to someone else.

397
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:23,570
如果只是一时兴起 那就结束它 明白吗
If this is a fling, it's over. You understand me?

398
00:15:24,070 --> 00:15:25,540
但如果你们来真的
But if this is something real,

399
00:15:25,540 --> 00:15:26,710
你必须跟贝丝坦白
you need to be honest with Beth.

400
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,620
是时候像个男人一样负起责任来了
It's time to step up and be a man.

401
00:15:28,850 --> 00:15:29,660
我明白了
I understand.

402
00:15:29,660 --> 00:15:31,020
让我告诉你些事
Let me tell you something.

403
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,340
人生就像蜿蜒的山路
Life is like a mountain road

404
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:35,450
每个转角都有新的奇遇在等着你
with a new adventure around every corner.

405
00:15:36,730 --> 00:15:37,550
很赞吧
Right?

406
00:15:37,550 --> 00:15:39,570
-你刚自己想出来的吗 -是的
- Did you just think of that? - I did.

407
00:15:54,130 --> 00:15:55,360
气氛似乎有点紧张
Seems tense.

408
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:59,550
你姐姐是个大麻烦 对吧
Your big sis is kind of a disaster, huh?

409
00:15:59,730 --> 00:16:03,240
费格 如你所说 我们有很多相像的地方
Fig, we are a lot alike, like you said.

410
00:16:03,390 --> 00:16:05,400
有些时候我们可以下意识
And sometimes we can give off

411
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:07,410
就将负面的情绪释放出去
a negative vibe without meaning to.

412
00:16:07,410 --> 00:16:08,350
你想说什么
What's your point?

413
00:16:08,350 --> 00:16:11,910
我在想 也许我们可以再努力一点
Well, I was thinking maybe we could make more of an effort

414
00:16:11,910 --> 00:16:15,930
更积极一些 真正去享受圣诞节
to be more positive and actually enjoy Christmas.

415
00:16:15,950 --> 00:16:17,160
像个傻子一样吗
As a goof?

416
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:20,170
好吧 这样 新计划
Okay, all right, new plan.

417
00:16:20,170 --> 00:16:23,790
我们等海莉和安迪的事结束以后
We wait until the whole Haley/Andy thing blows over.

418
00:16:23,830 --> 00:16:25,760
-每个人都微醺了 -除你以外
- Everyone gets a little liquored up. - Other people.

419
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:28,870
然后 就在饭后甜点前 你坐到钢琴前
And then, right before dessert, you sit down at the piano.

420
00:16:28,870 --> 00:16:32,270
-*平安夜* -外面搞什么
- *Silent night* - What the hell is that?

421
00:16:32,410 --> 00:16:35,790
*圣善夜*
*Holy night*

422
00:16:35,810 --> 00:16:39,540
*真宁静*
*All is calm*

423
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:43,420
*真光明*
*All is bright*

424
00:16:43,420 --> 00:16:49,740
*圣光环绕圣母圣婴*
*Round yon virgin mother and child*

425
00:16:49,740 --> 00:16:51,100
-真见鬼 -我他...
- Son of a bitch! - Mother...

426
00:16:51,110 --> 00:16:58,030
*圣洁婴孩纯真可爱*
*Holy infant, so tender and mild*

427
00:16:58,030 --> 00:17:04,160
*尽享天赐安眠*
*Sleep in heavenly peace*

428
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,740
不管了 我要喝酒
That's it. I'm drinking.

429
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:13,660
*尽享天赐安眠*
*Sleep in heavenly peace*

430
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:19,710
悲催套餐 再续一年
That's got to hurt!

431
00:17:24,630 --> 00:17:25,940
西葫芦花
Hey, zucchini blossom!

432
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:27,850
虾米花 听我说
Hey, popcorn shrimp, listen.

433
00:17:27,990 --> 00:17:30,610
出了点事 而且...
Something is going on, and...

434
00:17:30,990 --> 00:17:34,520
虽然很令人伤感 但我想我们还是该谈一下
As painful as it may be, I think we should talk about it.

435
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,940
你总是能看透我的内心
You could always see through me.

436
00:17:37,630 --> 00:17:39,890
-怎么回事 -是的 我认识了一个人
- What now? - Yes, I met someone.

437
00:17:40,010 --> 00:17:42,820
我背着你跟他好了有几个月了
I've been dating him for a few months behind your back.

438
00:17:43,490 --> 00:17:45,450
我给他也戴绿帽子了
And I'm actually cheating on him, too.

439
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:46,530
是指我给他戴的吗
You mean with me?

440
00:17:46,530 --> 00:17:47,850
不
No!

441
00:17:48,350 --> 00:17:49,500
不
No.

442
00:17:51,170 --> 00:17:52,960
虾米花
Popcorn shrimp.

443
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:56,350
计划微调
Well, slight change of plans.

444
00:17:56,350 --> 00:17:57,810
我要走了
I'm gonna be going.

445
00:17:58,030 --> 00:17:59,560
祝大家圣诞快乐
Merry Christmas, everyone.

446
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,160
再见 贝丝
Bye, Beth!

447
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,780
开车注意安全
Drive safe!

448
00:18:02,980 --> 00:18:03,980
保持联络
Keep in touch!

449
00:18:03,980 --> 00:18:05,980
我觉得跟她不会再跟我们联络了
I don't see us keeping in touch.

450
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:07,780
你跟贝丝分手了吗
Hey, you broke up with Beth?

451
00:18:07,780 --> 00:18:10,400
她劈腿了 真难以置信
She cheated on me. I can't believe it.

452
00:18:10,450 --> 00:18:12,430
-等等 你很难过吗 -当然会难过
- Wait, you're upset? - Of course I'm upset.

453
00:18:12,430 --> 00:18:14,040
我们在一起十年了
We dated for 10 years.

454
00:18:14,040 --> 00:18:15,430
我觉得被人从背后捅了一刀
I just got stabbed in the back.

455
00:18:15,430 --> 00:18:17,780
-欢迎加入我们的阵营 -不是吧
- Welcome to the club. - Really?

456
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:19,120
你被从背后捅过一刀吗
You were stabbed in the back?

457
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:21,980
女儿嘲弄自己父亲的人生
A daughter mocking her father's life.

458
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:24,500
衣橱并没那么好 从何时开始的
Closets aren't fascinating? Since when?

459
00:18:24,500 --> 00:18:26,100
想聊聊背叛的话题吗
Want to talk about betrayal?

460
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:28,720
你们觉得有人偷了别人的歌
How about when somebody steals a song

461
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:30,500
然后占为己有这事怎么样
and takes it for themselveses?

462
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:33,080
我不知道你们打算唱那首歌
I had no idea that you guys were gonna sing that song.

463
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:34,520
我知道 我听见他们彩排了
I did. I heard them rehearsing.

464
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:36,580
我还以为墙里困了只动物呢
I thought there was an animal stuck in the wall.

465
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:39,190
别忘了是我们邀请你来我门家的
And to think we invited you into our home.

466
00:18:39,190 --> 00:18:41,350
我们真该把你留在外面热着
We should've left you out in the warm.

467
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:42,790
我明白你很生气 不过别忘了
I get that you're upset, but remember,

468
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:43,980
你胖的时候我依然喜欢你
I even liked you when you were fat.

469
00:18:43,980 --> 00:18:46,070
他们给我们这样的人颁奖
They give out awards to people like me!

470
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:48,830
我放弃了去卡波的三天旅行
I gave up a three-day trip to Cabo

471
00:18:48,830 --> 00:18:50,630
就为了敲定那个最好的西部合约
to close that best Western deal.

472
00:18:50,630 --> 00:18:53,350
没错 你欠她25杯玛格丽特酒
That's right. You owe her 25 margaritas!

473
00:18:53,350 --> 00:18:55,010
-菲尔 -21杯
- Phil! - 21!

474
00:18:55,010 --> 00:18:57,300
-21杯 -够了 够了
- 21! - Enough, enough, enough!

475
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:59,290
我只想过个白人过的圣诞节
All I wanted was a white Christmas,

476
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:01,320
所以我没回哥伦比亚
and instead, I'm back in Colombia --

477
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:05,780
这燥热 这些背叛 还有人偷歌
the heat, the betrayal, people stealing songs!

478
00:19:05,780 --> 00:19:07,180
现在到此为止
This ends now!

479
00:19:07,190 --> 00:19:11,400
安迪 别抱怨了 你该感激海莉会喜欢你
Andy, stop whining and be grateful that Haley likes you!

480
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:15,250
她是实打实的满分女神 你去犹他也算不上帅
She's a stone-cold 10, and you're a Utah 7!

481
00:19:15,250 --> 00:19:19,200
杰 你该亲克莱尔跟她言归于好
Jay, it's time for you and Caire to kiss and make up!

482
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,970
他为什么不去亲查克·菲尼
Why doesn't he kiss Chuck Feeny?!

483
00:19:20,970 --> 00:19:23,100
因为根本没有查克·菲尼这个人
Because there's no Chuck Feeny!

484
00:19:23,100 --> 00:19:24,930
他编出来考验你的
He made it up to test you!

485
00:19:24,930 --> 00:19:28,340
如果她根本不在乎的话 就不会这么难过了
And if she didn't care, she wouldn't be this upset!

486
00:19:28,570 --> 00:19:30,060
根本没有查克·菲尼吗
There is no Chuck Feeny?

487
00:19:30,060 --> 00:19:31,140
这是个愚蠢的主意
It was a dumb idea,

488
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:33,470
不过我目睹了唐·麦克索里的结局
but I saw what happened to Don McSorley!

489
00:19:33,470 --> 00:19:34,600
那个杰出的百叶窗商人
The crackerjack blinds guy.

490
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,920
你只花了原价8%的钱就买下了他的整个公司
You got his whole company for 8 cents on the dollar.

491
00:19:36,930 --> 00:19:39,190
我才花了7块就把他的复印机买了
I bought his photocopier for 7 bucks.

492
00:19:39,840 --> 00:19:41,270
我一直都希望你能接手公司
I always hoped you'd take over the company.

493
00:19:41,270 --> 00:19:42,880
没人比你更受我信任了
There's no one I trust more than you.

494
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:45,150
我只是想知道这是否真是你想要的
I just had to know that you really wanted it!

495
00:19:45,150 --> 00:19:48,100
你想知道我是否愿意经营一间不仅能为人提供
That I wanted to run a company that gives people a place

496
00:19:48,100 --> 00:19:50,470
存放衣物的场所 还可以存放梦想的公司吗
to store not only their jeans, but their dreams?

497
00:19:50,470 --> 00:19:51,810
-我愿意 -给
- Yes! - Here.

498
00:19:52,490 --> 00:19:54,760
提前把圣诞礼物送给你
I got you a little early Christmas present.

499
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:59,090
克莱尔·邓菲 总裁
"Claire Dunphy, C.E.O."

500
00:19:59,090 --> 00:20:00,830
你啊
Oh, you!

501
00:20:01,900 --> 00:20:03,530
这还差不多
That's more like it!

502
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:05,270
谁还在乎外面天气如何
Who cares what the weather is?

503
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:08,000
重要的是我们拥有彼此
What is important is that we have each other!

504
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:10,110
雪
Snow!

505
00:20:10,220 --> 00:20:13,610
仁君温瑟拉[圣诞颂歌] 下雪了
Good King Wenceslas, there is snow!

506
00:20:15,910 --> 00:20:18,680
我说了一切都会好起来的
I told you everything was going to work out.

507
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:21,100
真是个完美的圣诞节
It's a perfect Christmas.

508
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:25,560
-你们看什么呢 -雪
- What are we looking at? - Snow!

509
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:27,380
圣诞节的奇迹
Our miracle for Christmas.

510
00:20:27,380 --> 00:20:28,680
那不是雪
That's not snow.

511
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,950
那是森林大火的灰尘
That's ashes from a forest fire.

512
00:20:30,950 --> 00:20:32,940
如果你们安静下来 能听到有人尖叫的
If you're quiet, you can hear screaming.

513
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:37,570
菲尔 你查看过所有的抽屉了吗
Phil, did you look in all the drawers?

514
00:20:37,570 --> 00:20:39,570
是的 床底下也看了 什么也没落下
Yep, and under the bed. Got everything.

515
00:20:39,570 --> 00:20:41,760
-再见 歌洛莉亚 谢谢你 -再见
- Bye, Gloria. Thank you. - Bye.

516
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:45,220
杰 别忘了乔的新洋娃娃
Jay, don't forget Joe's new doll.

517
00:20:45,850 --> 00:20:48,720
米奇和小卡总是想把人逼上断背山
Mitch and Cam -- always pushing their agenda.

518
00:20:51,170 --> 00:20:52,420
再见 房子
Bye-bye, house!

519
00:20:52,420 --> 00:20:54,490
我们会想念你的
We will miss you!

520
00:21:04,770 --> 00:21:05,760
有人吗
Hello?

521
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:07,570
有人吗
Hello?!

522
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:09,530
是我 卢克
I-it's me -- Luke!

523
00:21:11,950 --> 00:21:13,950
我好像把自己锁在这里了
I think I locked myself in here!

524
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:36,840
这里好像还有别的什么东西
I don't think I'm alone here.
